{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>皇崗口岸早前嚴重塞車。萬聖節凌晨，到蘭桂坊扮鬼或到啟德看演唱會而不在香港過夜的旅客，深夜急着乘巴士離港返回深圳。往皇崗口岸的交通大致順暢。記者晚上11時登上由啟德開往皇崗的巴士，約50分鐘後抵達入境大樓巴士總站。站內有多名交通警員指揮，入境大樓張貼告示：「請勿在此停留，正實施客流管制措施」。入境處「口岸通」在晚上12時30分顯示，离境的香港旅客及訪港旅客人流「繁忙」。皇崗口岸兩度亮起「黃燈」，旅客輪候30至45分鐘方可過關。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-29-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-25-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.23.25-1-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.23.22-3-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.23.26-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.23.23-2-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.23.26-2-1-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.27.10-2-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.27.10-1-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.23.23-1-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.27.09-3-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.27.09-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"684\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-01-at-00.27.10-1-1024x684.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><br/>在皇崗口岸入境「合作查驗」自動通道，大批旅客滯留隊伍中。入境處職員不斷呼籲旅客使用人工通道；部分旅客未能使用合作查驗自動通道，讀取證件失敗，因而從自動通道閘機轉往人工通道。有旅客從自動通道轉往人工櫃位後表示，前面有旅客證件未能過關，等了良久隊伍仍沒有移動；被問及已等多久，他表示前面排了二十多人。也有旅客到達皇崗後，臨近過關仍未卸下萬聖節化妝。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-01-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-07-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-17-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-05-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-18-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-09-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>有旅客感身體不適，入境處職員安排「插隊」先過關。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-08-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>來到關口仍未卸妝。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-04-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-21-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261031_Halloween_HuangGang-19-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p><strong><em>旅客返回深圳後，因沒有網約車而滯留於皇崗口岸內地方候車大堂。</em></strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:09.210383+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":469,"images":24,"source":"The 